00:08:18.868 --> 00:08:20.660
So the interesting
thing about this service

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.730
is, although it's a
cloud service working

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.620
for a large set of
customers, we're

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:27.200
making sure that we bring
up every Active Directory

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:29.180
