off on on-premises.

00:40:10.000 --> 00:40:13.600
So this is an app, and
its back-end database

00:40:13.600 --> 00:40:16.150
running in an on-premises
VM is actually

00:40:16.150 --> 00:40:19.850
a Linux-based VM this time
that we're looking at.

00:40:19.850 --> 00:40:24.140
I go ahead, and I have this ADUC
from on-premises connected up

00:40:24.140 --> 00:40:27.260
to the GCP-managed
Active Directory domain.

00:40:27.260 --> 00:40:29.540
As you can see,
that is a user Jane

00:40:29.540 --> 00:40:32.780
we have precreated
in that AD domain.

00:40:32.780 --> 00:40:35.630
I'm now logging in
using Jane's identity

00:40:35.630 --> 00:40:39.560
into SuiteCRM app, which
is so far and still running

00:40:39.560 --> 00:40:41.940
on-premises.

00:40:41.940 --> 00:40:44.760
As this loads, Jane can
get to all of her data

00:40:44.760 --> 00:40:46.532
and go about her work.

00:40:46.532 --> 00:40:47.990
We'll now do
something interesting.

00:40:47.990 --> 00:40:52.597
a You heard us talk about Anthos
Migrate, also known as-- well,

00:40:52.597 --> 00:40:53.180
to start out--

00:40:53.180 --> 00:40:55.360
V2K technology yesterday.

00:40:55.360 --> 00:40:58.370
The command that I just ran
in the bottom of the screen

00:40:58.370 --> 00:41:02.330
actually went ahead and took
those VMs and modernized them.

00:41:02.330 --> 00:41:04.380
As I hit refresh
and this comes up,

00:41:04.380 --> 00:41:07.730
you will see that those
applications are now running

00:41:07.730 --> 00:41:11.880
in a StatefulSet on GKE.

00:41:11.880 --> 00:41:13.830
I dig in, and I'm going
to go ahead and make

00:41:13.830 --> 00:41:15.850
a note of the IP address.

00:41:15.850 --> 00:41:18.910
This is where the
application is running now.

00:41:18.910 --> 00:41:22.320
So you just saw state.vm
running on-premises, now

00:41:22.320 --> 00:41:25.440
running in a container using
our other GCP offerings,

00:41:25.440 --> 00:41:29.273
while still utilizing the
GCP-managed AD service.

00:41:29.273 --> 00:41:30.690
The way that fits
into the picture

00:41:30.690 --> 00:41:33.960
is we're now going to go
ahead and log in to that app,

00:41:33.960 --> 00:41:36.600
now running in a container,
using the same user

00:41:36.600 --> 00:41:40.088
