while it was still on-premises.

00:41:40.088 --> 00:41:41.630
And so as we go
ahead and hit log in,

00:41:41.630 --> 00:41:43.280
you'll see this complete.

00:41:43.280 --> 00:41:45.230
Jane can access her data.

00:41:45.230 --> 00:41:48.200
And this is how-- while we do
focus and empower traditional

00:41:48.200 --> 00:41:49.370
applications--

00:41:49.370 --> 00:41:52.280
you have a good example of
utilizing the managed AD

00:41:52.280 --> 00:41:56.810
